; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-point-ideal-basis.py; checked native terms.
; The two actual factor equations
; force a degree-one case for p, contradicting its supplied
; degree-one exclusion. Prove this with product degree and exact
; Nat indices, using native negative exhaustive elimination,
; not a coefficient equality decision or excluded-middle axiom.
(#alias add = ./../fermat_statement.lim::add)
(#alias commutative-ring = ./commutative-ring-data.lim::commutative-ring)
(#alias
  coordinate-norm-degree-exhaustive-elimination
  =
  ./coordinate-norm-degree-exhaustive.lim::coordinate-norm-degree-exhaustive-elimination)
